<section class="ht-legal" data-legal-department>
  <div class="ht-legal__grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header class="ht-intake">
    <div class="ht-intake__counter-edge" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ht-intake__desk">
      <div class="ht-intake__letter" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>INCOMING</span>
        <i></i><i></i><i></i>
      </div>
      <div class="ht-intake__folder">
        <div class="ht-intake__tabs" aria-label="Case intake status">
          <span>Received</span>
          <span>Reviewed</span>
          <span>Regrettably Real</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ht-intake__folder-body">
          <div class="ht-intake__file-code">HTNYC · INTAKE FORM 003</div>
          <h1><span>Hat Trick</span> Legal Department</h1>
          <p>Brooklyn field office · File cabinet B</p>
          <div class="ht-intake__routing" aria-label="Partially redacted routing slip">
            <b>ROUTING SLIP</b>
            <span>TO: <i class="redact redact--sm">Counsel</i></span>
            <span>RE: <i class="redact redact--md">Strongly worded mail</i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="ht-intake__count"><small>OPEN CASES</small><strong>003</strong></div>
          <div class="ht-intake__stamp" aria-hidden="true">PLEASE<br>ADVISE</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="ht-intake__notice">
    <strong>PUBLIC RECORDS ROUTING NOTE</strong>
    <p>Names and identifying details have been partially redacted. The hats, unfortunately for counsel, photographed beautifully.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ht-legal__files">
    <article class="ht-case ht-case--blue" id="case-001">
      <header class="ht-case__tab"><span>CASE FILE</span><strong>HT–LEGAL–001</strong><i>RETIRED</i></header>
      <div class="ht-case__grid">
        <div class="ht-case__evidence">
          <div class="ht-case__photo"><img src="{{ 'ht-legal-boeing-hat-redacted-bw.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1050" height="1400" loading="lazy" alt="Black-and-white aerospace parody hat with its embroidery redacted"><span>EXHIBIT A</span></div>
          <div class="ht-case__tag"><small>ITEM</small><b>THE AEROSPACE INCIDENT</b><small>PHOTOGRAPHED BEFORE RETIREMENT</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ht-case__letter">
          <div class="ht-letter">
            <div class="ht-letter__mast"><b>PACIFIC NORTHWEST AIRSPACE DIVISION</b><span>10.01.25</span></div>
            <p class="ht-letter__to">TO: HAT TRICK NYC<br>RE: B█████ / S██████S MARKS</p>
            <h2>NOTICE OF<br>UNAUTHORIZED FLIGHT PLAN</h2>
            <p>Our office has been advised that a royal-blue mesh cap combines the insignia of a certain aerospace manufacturer with the name of a professional football club located somewhere near Puget Sound.</p>
            <p>The relevant parties—B█████ and the S██████S—deny authorizing this departure and request that all remaining units be grounded immediately.</p>
            <div class="ht-letter__lines"><i></i><i></i><i class="short"></i></div>
            <p><b>ALLEGEDLY INFRINGING CONTENT:</b><br>ONE BLUE TRUCKER CAP · TAIL NO. <span class="redact redact--sm">SEA–206</span></p>
            <div class="ht-letter__stamp">FLIGHT<br>GROUNDED</div>
          </div>
          <dl class="ht-case__facts"><div><dt>ALLEGED OFFENSE</dt><dd>Unauthorized aerospace touchdown</dd></div><div><dt>DEMAND</dt><dd>Ground all remaining units</dd></div><div><dt>DISPOSITION</dt><dd>Removed from active roster</dd></div></dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="ht-case ht-case--green" id="case-002">
      <header class="ht-case__tab"><span>CASE FILE</span><strong>HT–LEGAL–002</strong><i>COMPLIED, RELUCTANTLY</i></header>
      <div class="ht-case__grid">
        <div class="ht-case__evidence">
          <div class="ht-case__photo"><img src="{{ 'ht-legal-oregon-hat-redacted-bw.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1200" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt="Black-and-white camouflage collegiate parody hat with its embroidery redacted"><span>EXHIBIT A</span></div>
          <div class="ht-case__tag"><small>ITEM</small><b>THE WATERFOWL INCIDENT</b><small>CAMOUFLAGE FAILED TO CONCEAL EVIDENCE</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ht-case__letter">
          <div class="ht-letter">
            <div class="ht-letter__mast"><b>MIGRATORY MARKS &amp; SCHOOL COLORS DIVISION</b><span>10.01.25</span></div>
            <p class="ht-letter__to">TO: HAT TRICK NYC<br>RE: UNLICENSED WATERFOWL &amp; PROTECTED COLORS</p>
            <h2>NOTICE OF UNAUTHORIZED<br>WATERFOWL ACTIVITY</h2>
            <p>Our office has been advised that a camouflage cap was observed carrying a protected collegiate duck accompanied by restricted green-and-yellow plumage.</p>
            <p>Camouflage does not constitute authorization and, in this instance, failed to conceal the evidence. The institution asserts rights in the bird, the word, the colors and, apparently, the general idea of looking like Oregon.</p>
            <div class="ht-letter__lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i class="short"></i></div>
            <p><b>SUBJECT IN CUSTODY:</b><br><span class="redact redact--md">UNLICENSED WATERFOWL</span></p>
            <div class="ht-letter__stamp">DUCK SEASON<br>CLOSED</div>
          </div>
          <dl class="ht-case__facts"><div><dt>ALLEGED OFFENSE</dt><dd>Possession of protected plumage</dd></div><div><dt>DEMAND</dt><dd>Remove bird, colors, and evidence</dd></div><div><dt>DISPOSITION</dt><dd>Migrated off the active roster</dd></div></dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="ht-case ht-case--orange" id="case-003">
      <header class="ht-case__tab"><span>CASE FILE</span><strong>HT–LEGAL–003</strong><i>STRONGLY WORDED</i></header>
      <div class="ht-case__grid">
        <div class="ht-case__evidence">
          <div class="ht-case__photo"><img src="{{ 'ht-legal-knicks-hat-redacted-bw.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1200" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt="Black-and-white New York basketball parody hat with three redaction lines across its embroidery"><span>EXHIBIT A</span></div>
          <div class="ht-case__tag"><small>ITEM</small><b>THE COURTSIDE INCIDENT</b><small>ONE HAT · EIGHT PAGES · ZERO CHILL</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ht-case__letter">
          <div class="ht-letter">
            <div class="ht-letter__mast"><b>COURTSIDE INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY UNIT</b><span>06.19.26</span></div>
            <p class="ht-letter__to">VIA EMAIL &amp; FEDEX<br>RE: DOING THE WRONG THING</p>
            <h2>FORMAL NOTICE OF<br>DOING THE WRONG THING</h2>
            <p>Our office represents a prolific filmmaker, longtime courtside resident and owner of a vast portfolio spanning film, television, music, merchandise and highly recognizable typography.</p>
            <p>The evidence includes one cap, one reworked poster, one website search result, pages from a book and multiple alleged intentional references. Eight pages later, the position remains: stop immediately.</p>
            <div class="ht-letter__lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <p><b>RESPONSE REQUESTED:</b><br>BY TOMORROW, APPARENTLY.</p>
            <div class="ht-letter__stamp">COURTSIDE<br>EJECTION</div>
          </div>
          <dl class="ht-case__facts"><div><dt>ALLEGED OFFENSE</dt><dd>Doing the wrong thing</dd></div><div><dt>DEMAND</dt><dd>Stop, account, destroy</dd></div><div><dt>DISPOSITION</dt><dd>Bench cleared</dd></div></dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <footer class="ht-legal__footer">
    <div><span>DAYS SINCE LAST LEGAL CORRESPONDENCE</span><strong data-legal-days>000</strong></div>
    <p>This archive is presented for commentary and documentary purposes. Sensitive information has been removed. No endorsement or affiliation is implied. Please direct all future strongly worded correspondence to the drawer labeled “unfortunately.”</p>
  </footer>
</section>

